post.summary:
Issue a personal token. Needs the password confirmed just now (`POST /auth/step-up`);
the policy of the organization decides who may, for how long and with which permissions.
The value comes once, in this answer.

Send a public form: anyone with its link. The task of the proof-of-work given by
the form must be answered, once; the sendings of a form and of an address are limited;
the record is by nobody, written with the rights of who made the link.
